# Reflection

Edict 0010. Daedalus reads its own Claude Code session logs, counts what happened
(digests), and on a schedule writes a reflection with checked citations. What it
learns becomes proposals you apply, and two models: what it has learned about
you, and about itself. Everything here stays on this machine.

