│  daily    10-14      rolled into W41 │                                                           │
│  monthly  2026-10    not yet (open)  │ 23 sessions across 2 projects. Small days roll up         │
│                                      │ into the week.                                            │
│  ⚠ 2 sessions undigested;            │                                                           │
│    Claude Code deletes them in 6d    ├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
